# env.optional — enrichment only; the skill runs fully (keyless) without these.
#
# Measured keyword volume / difficulty via scripts/paid_seo.py (DataForSEO, HTTP Basic
# auth). When set, per-subtopic volume/difficulty upgrade from directional to "measured";
# absent -> directional from Autocomplete + SERP probes (adapter exits gracefully,
# keyless flow continues):
DATAFORSEO_LOGIN
DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD
# Alternative paid providers (NOT implemented in paid_seo.py; out-of-band only):
KEYWORD_ANALYSIS_API_KEY
SEMRUSH_API_KEY
AHREFS_API_TOKEN
KEYWORDS_EVERYWHERE_API_KEY
# Reddit community-question mining / hostile-site crawl fallback (absent -> SERP probes):
APIFY_API_TOKEN
